OL,3,GNEWSARailway line reopens after
OL,4,Anine-day closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of railway in Kent has
OL,7,Freopened following a nine-day closure
OL,8,Ffor "essential" works, Southeastern
OL,9,Fsays.
OL,11,FThe line between Tonbridge and Wadhurst
OL,12,Fshut on 24 October, with the closure
OL,13,Fbeing extended to Battle in East Sussex
OL,14,Fon the final day.
OL,16,FTom Moore, speaking on behalf of
OL,17,FNetwork Rail and train operator
OL,18,FSoutheastern, had said the closure over
OL,19,Fthe school holiday was "short-term pain
OL,20,Ffor longer-term gain".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
